# Stable spec ID: morgenthaler-flannel-shirt. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(Scotch whisky) 50 ml
(apple juice, fresh unfiltered non-alcoholic) 45 ml
(amaro @ Averna) 15 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 7.5 ml
(simple syrup, 2:1 brown sugar to water) 5 ml
(liqueur; allspice) 2.5 ml
(bitters @ Angostura) 2 dashes

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(rocks glass)

